/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field access on array values in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported fields:
 *   - len   — number of elements in the array (compile-time constant)
 *   - ptr   — pointer to the first element of the array
 *
 * This module is invoked by FieldValidation when the left operand is an ArrayType.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::fields::array
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/fields/array.yr
 * @Author(s):
